Z||000003||82-T/A||12-02-2000||11:23 PM||||Hey cool!! I ran track too. I ran the open 800meters in 2 minutes and 3 seconds.<P>As for my car, I once had a totally stock 1985 Fiero GT 4-Speed.. with the only mod being a 4.10:1 4-speed... so I guess it wasn't totally stock, and it ran a 14.82 et at 89.3 miles an hour at Moroso. <P>The car had NO options.. totally stock. The tranny went out, so it was replaced with a stock unit from a Chevy Cavalier.. exact same transmission, just a slightly higher gear ratio.<P>Only options the car had were A/C and WS6. Didn't even come with a spoiler... no t-tops or sunroof.. just a hard top.<P>Car was awesome..<P>I sold it though.<P><P>------------------<BR>Todd Jaspers<BR>1997 Pontiac GrandAm SE<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero SE/V6<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2m4 SE<BR>http://www.ezshots.com/album.cgi?82tafiero/Apartment||||reg||1
